"hero": "\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\">{{ppp:breadcrumbs}}<span class=\"eyebrow\">Ellis Services Group · Perth</span><h1>Shower Plumbing Leak Repairs Perth</h1><p class=\"expanded-lead\">Shower plumbing leak repairs in Perth for leaking fittings and suspected supply or waste pipe faults. We assess where water is coming from and separate plumbing repair from waterproofing or other building work.</p><p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=shower-plumbing-repairs-perth.html\">Arrange a visit &amp; quote</a></p><p class=\"expanded-hours\">Routine service hours: 09:00–21:00, seven days a week. 24-hour emergency repairs are available; call to confirm attendance arrangements and the quoted emergency work. No arrival time is guaranteed.</p><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"expanded-toc\"><a href=\"#service-scope\">Service scope</a><a href=\"#service-scenarios\">Common situations</a><a href=\"#service-quote\">Process &amp; quote</a><a href=\"#service-faq\">FAQs</a></nav></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"sections": [
{
"id": "section-1",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scope\">Shower leak repairs Perth: service scope</h2><ul><li>Assess shower taps, mixers and plumbing connections for leaks.</li><li>Investigate suspected supply and waste pipe faults and quote for the identified plumbing repair.</li><li>Agree any access and making-good responsibilities before opening finishes.</li><li>Waterproofing membrane replacement, tiling and structural repairs are not included unless separately confirmed; no promise of a no-tile-removal repair.</li></ul><p>We confirm the property, installation and requested outcome before selecting the work. Fixed plumbing and electrical tasks are handled by the appropriate qualified trade; a coordinated visit does not make every task interchangeable. Current documentation relevant to the proposed work can be requested privately.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Perth plumbing services</a></li><li><a href=\"water-leak-detection-perth.html\">Concealed water leak assessment</a></li><li><a href=\"tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">Shower tap and mixer repairs</a></li><li><a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">A shower drain that backs up</a></li><li><a href=\"burst-pipe-repair-perth.html\">Leaking pipe repairs</a></li><li><a href=\"service-areas.html\">Perth service regions</a></li></ul></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-2",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section expanded-scenarios\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scenarios\">Common situations and what to report</h2><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>A damp ceiling after an upstairs shower</h3><p>Water appears downstairs after the shower is used. The timing is useful, but does not prove whether the supply, waste connection or waterproofing is responsible. Describe when it appears and any nearby fixtures in use without opening the ceiling or disturbing tiles.</p></div><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>A damp wall with no visible tap leak</h3><p>Concealed pipework, waste connections and water escaping through other parts of the shower can produce similar dampness. We investigate the plumbing scope and discuss any access needed. Do not assume that an apparently dry tap rules out a plumbing leak.</p></div><p>These are illustrative situations, not customer case studies or diagnoses. Report what you have noticed; you do not need to identify the cause before contacting us.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-3",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-quote\">Assessment, work plan and written quote</h2><ol class=\"expanded-steps\"><li><strong>Describe the job.</strong> Give the suburb, affected equipment or planned installation, when it began and whether the condition is worsening. Add safe access and the person who can approve the work.</li><li><strong>Assess the installation.</strong> We check the relevant equipment and connections on site. Concealed work, product compatibility and the cause of a fault cannot be guaranteed from an enquiry or photograph.</li><li><strong>Agree the scope.</strong> The written quote identifies attendance or investigation, the selected equipment, materials and agreed work. Confirm GST, disposal, access, testing and any making good that applies to the specific job.</li><li><strong>Approve changes separately.</strong> If findings change the required work, we explain the additional scope and charge before proceeding. Confirm the checks and completion information needed for a rental or managed property.</li></ol><p>Published standard-hours guide ranges elsewhere on this site are not a fixed price for this unseen job. Emergency repair charges follow the quoted plan. There is no assumed free attendance, unlimited investigation or universal hourly rate.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "service-faq",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq\" id=\"service-faq\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Shower Plumbing Leak Repairs Perth FAQs</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>Prepare the request and approval</h3><p>Give the property location, observable symptoms or intended installation, access contact and the person who can approve the work. The agreed quote sets out the assessment and work; submitting a form does not reserve an appointment.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Perth plumbing services</a></li><li><a href=\"water-leak-detection-perth.html\">Concealed water leak assessment</a></li><li><a href=\"tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">Shower tap and mixer repairs</a></li><li><a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">A shower drain that backs up</a></li><li><a href=\"burst-pipe-repair-perth.html\">Leaking pipe repairs</a></li></ul></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
